251	     * Handles {@link DisposableEmailDomainException} raised when a submitted owner {@code email} has a
252	     * domain on the disposable-domain blocklist (e.g. mailinator.com).
253	     *
254	     * @param e The {@link DisposableEmailDomainException} to be handled
